## 8. Ideal Customer Profiles

### 8.1 Primary ICP

Organizations with:

- complex, multi-disciplinary delivery;
- more than one accountable stakeholder group;
- significant cost of misunderstanding or rework;
- AI-assisted or agentic processes;
- customer and supplier interdependence;
- audit, regulatory, contractual, safety, or reputational exposure;
- reusable organizational standards;
- and a need to prove achievement rather than merely report activity.

### 8.2 Priority sectors

Initial commercial priority may include:

- financial services and insurance;
- healthcare and medical software;
- government and defense;
- aerospace and critical infrastructure;
- enterprise software;
- professional services;
- legal services;
- systems integration;
- construction and engineering;
- regulated manufacturing;
- telecommunications;
- and large-scale procurement ecosystems.

Marketing must preserve the wider cross-domain identity even when campaigns focus on a particular vertical.

